WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.968
-As excited as people are

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:03.336 align:start size:94% position:6%
to see someone
from "Game of Thrones" --

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:04.637 size:84% position:42%
the show is so loved --

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
I feel like you have been
on the other side of fandom.

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:08.008
You are a huge Madonna fan.

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:09.509 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is this true?
-Yeah.

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:11.711
-This is a lifelong adoration?
-Yeah, since I was 8 years old.

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:12.912 align:start size:94% position:6%
-8 years old.
-8 years old.

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:15.448
And I used to dress up
as Madonna in my bedroom,

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:18.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I would try to copy
the dance routines,

00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:20.286 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I would be doing
my Madonna look.

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:22.956
I´d borrow my mother´s makeup.
I mean, I´d really go there.

00:00:22.956 --> 00:00:24.657 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I´d go there on the look.

00:00:24.657 --> 00:00:26.726 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it was a lifelong passion,
you know?

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:28.695 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And you recently
just got to see this --

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:30.597
was this the first time
you´d seen her in concert or --

00:00:30.597 --> 00:00:32.332
-This was the very first time

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:34.634 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´d ever seen Madonna
in concert.

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:37.570
And I was in Australia.
I was filming "Top of the Lake."

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:38.972 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I was in Sydney

00:00:38.972 --> 00:00:40.874
with my dear friend Alfie Allen
from "Game of Thrones."

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:42.342 size:75% position:38%
-Yes, Theon Greyjoy.

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:44.477
-And I said to him, "Come on.
Get us tickets to Madonna,"

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:46.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
which he did,
and I was very excited.

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:48.615 align:start size:94% position:6%
And on the day of the concert,
I was at home.

00:00:48.615 --> 00:00:51.451 align:start size:94% position:6%
I got a text --
I got that familiar "ding"

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:52.919
of a text message on the phone.
-Uh-huh. Sure.

00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:56.089 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I looked at the phone,
and the message said,

00:00:56.089 --> 00:00:57.757 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Hi, Gwendoline.

00:00:57.757 --> 00:01:01.728 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is Guy Oseary,
Madonna´s manager.

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:04.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
I understand you´re coming
to the gig tonight."

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:05.999 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is there a way
to text in this voice?

00:01:05.999 --> 00:01:07.867 align:start size:94% position:6%
´Cause I love it.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:10.203
I want all my texts -- Yeah.

00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:11.538 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is how
this particular text sounded.

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:12.705 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, okay, great.

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:14.174
-Exactly that exact intonation.
-Uh-huh.

00:01:14.174 --> 00:01:15.742
-And it said, "I hear you´re --

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:17.977 size:81% position:41%
I hear you´re coming
to the gig tonight" --

00:01:17.977 --> 00:01:20.847 align:start size:94% position:6%
continuing voice.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.847 --> 00:01:24.150 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Fancy jumping onstage with M?
She´s a fan."

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:27.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow.
[ Audience cheers ]

00:01:27.187 --> 00:01:28.555 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I cried.
-You cried?

00:01:28.555 --> 00:01:29.756 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-I cried.

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:31.724 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did you cry --
Did you cry right away,

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:32.992 align:start size:94% position:6%
or was it
one of those slow cries,

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:34.327 size:84% position:42%
where you were like,
"Oh, I´m not going to"?

00:01:34.327 --> 00:01:36.062 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you know what?
I look at it, and it was --

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:38.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, it was so involuntary --
the mouth opened,

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:41.234
then the slow wail of "Ahhhhhh!"

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:44.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Yeah.

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:45.505 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And here we have proof.
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:45.505 --> 00:01:47.006
-There you are onstage with her.

00:01:47.006 --> 00:01:48.942 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, there you are.
-Yeah.

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:50.043 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
-And so...

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:51.344 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:53.146 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...did you have
any responsibilities

00:01:53.146 --> 00:01:54.781 align:start size:94% position:6%
onstage with Madonna?
-I did, indeed.

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:56.483 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, I went to the concert.
So, I went to the concert.

00:01:56.483 --> 00:01:58.284 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was in the car --
I was in the car with Alfie

00:01:58.284 --> 00:02:01.654 align:start size:94% position:6%
slowly becoming mute
and physically paralyzed...

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:05.291
-Yeah. Sure.
-...through fear -- abject fear.

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:07.627 align:start size:94% position:6%
I arrive. We´re there.
I´m mute.

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:09.262
I´m just standing very quietly,

00:02:09.262 --> 00:02:10.697 align:start size:94% position:6%
and Alfie´s saying,
"Are you okay? Are you okay?"

00:02:10.697 --> 00:02:12.465 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´m like, "Yeah, I´m fine.
Yeah, I´m fine."

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:14.601 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Madonna appears,

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:19.038
and I start screaming so loudly,

00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:22.876 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think my lungs are going to
come out of my mouth.

00:02:22.876 --> 00:02:24.344 align:start size:94% position:6%
Alfie is saying,

00:02:24.344 --> 00:02:27.113
"Babe, I know you´re excited,
but can you calm down a bit?"

00:02:27.113 --> 00:02:28.314 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:30.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
Madonna starts doing
"Borderline."

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:32.519 align:start size:94% position:6%
She´s alongside us.
She´s playing the guitar.

00:02:32.519 --> 00:02:34.420 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´m screaming.

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:37.190 size:88% position:44%
She looks down and winks
and renders me silent.

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:38.291 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my God.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:39.559 align:start size:94% position:6%
She winked you --
She made you --

00:02:39.559 --> 00:02:42.128
-She winked at me, I was silent,

00:02:42.128 --> 00:02:43.263 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then the screaming
started again.

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:44.664 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my God.
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:46.399
-So they came up to me, and they
said, "Okay, are you ready?

00:02:46.399 --> 00:02:47.667 align:start size:94% position:6%
You´re going to go
up onstage now."

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:48.868 size:78% position:39%
This is for a segment

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:51.838 align:start size:94% position:6%
for Madonna´s song called
"Unapologetic Bitch."

00:02:51.838 --> 00:02:54.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
-And part of my time

00:02:54.474 --> 00:02:55.875 align:start size:94% position:6%
between receiving
the text message

00:02:55.875 --> 00:02:56.943
and going to the concert,

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:59.445 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´d watched this segment
on YouTube

00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:01.714
and rehearsed the choreography,

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:04.717 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I didn´t want to make
a fool of myself

00:03:04.717 --> 00:03:06.152 align:start size:94% position:6%
in front of Madonna.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:07.220 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Of course not.

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:09.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was practicing
alone in my apartment.

00:03:09.556 --> 00:03:10.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Practicing.

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:14.060 align:start size:94% position:6%
That´s Madonna there.
I´m undulating at Madonna.

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:16.696 align:start size:94% position:6%
So -- So, then it happens,
and they say, "Are you ready?"

00:03:16.696 --> 00:03:18.932 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I --
And I sort of go, "Ah."

00:03:18.932 --> 00:03:21.067
-Yeah.
-I just make that noise -- "Ah,"

00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:23.002
because there are 22,000 people
in the auditorium.

00:03:23.002 --> 00:03:24.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Sure.

00:03:24.204 --> 00:03:26.005 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then they gave me
a gentle push.

00:03:26.005 --> 00:03:27.840
Performance mode kicked in.

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:29.375 align:start size:94% position:6%
Those three years
of classical training, Seth...

00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:31.211 size:84% position:42%
-Yeah, they paid off.
-Well, for that moment.

00:03:31.211 --> 00:03:32.545 size:84% position:42%
-And it looks like here

00:03:32.545 --> 00:03:34.747 align:start size:94% position:6%
you´re screaming
and holding two bananas.

00:03:34.747 --> 00:03:36.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is that accurate?
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.583 --> 00:03:40.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
And let me just say --
this is exactly what I wanted

00:03:40.353 --> 00:03:42.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
the image of you onstage
with Madonna to be.

00:03:42.855 --> 00:03:44.657 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:44.657 --> 00:03:46.793 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:46.793 --> 00:03:48.294 align:start size:94% position:6%
The mouth.
-Yeah.

00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:50.363
-The mouth is open so wide.

00:03:50.363 --> 00:03:52.632 align:start size:94% position:6%
The jaw had unhinged
like a snake.

00:03:52.632 --> 00:03:54.667 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well,
just congratulations on that,

00:03:54.667 --> 00:03:56.369 align:start size:94% position:6%
and congratulations
on "Top of the Lake,"

00:03:56.369 --> 00:03:57.503 size:81% position:41%
such a fantastic show.

00:03:57.503 --> 00:03:59.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
Jane Campion --
an incredible director.

00:03:59.472 --> 00:04:00.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
Elisabeth Moss --
your wonderful costar.

00:04:00.707 --> 00:04:01.808 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.

00:04:01.808 --> 00:04:02.842 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I really enjoyed
the first episode.

00:04:02.842 --> 00:04:03.977 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you so much
for being here.

00:04:03.977 --> 00:04:05.311 align:start size:94% position:6%
So great to see you again.
-Thank you, Seth.

00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:06.713
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Gwendoline Christie, everybody!

